{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01213",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 6.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Doctor, I've brought them through. The observations are done, whenever you need them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.35,
      "end_seconds": 11.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Thanks, that's helpful. Hello, please sit. What's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.25,
      "end_seconds": 17.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.99,
      "end_seconds": 23.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.21,
      "end_seconds": 34.57,
      "duration_seconds": 9.36,
      "text": "I've been wanting contraception, and I wanted to get it checked. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.48,
      "end_seconds": 40.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 41.68,
      "end_seconds": 49.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "She is on hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.18,
      "end_seconds": 52.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.76,
      "end_seconds": 67.81,
      "duration_seconds": 13.05,
      "text": "Honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before, you know, I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.34,
      "end_seconds": 71.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.62,
      "end_seconds": 81.74,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly. And there's slightly heavy periods as well, uh, about a week now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.46,
      "end_seconds": 89.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any breast lumps, migraine with aura or smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.84,
      "end_seconds": 93.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.38,
      "end_seconds": 98.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.54,
      "end_seconds": 101.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.86,
      "end_seconds": 105.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.51,
      "end_seconds": 117.35,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "text": "Eczema, for two years. My neighbour said I should get it looked at. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.39,
      "end_seconds": 127.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Ah. Yes, eczema is known to us, good to have that clear. Alright, anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.78,
      "end_seconds": 135.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "So, just a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.94,
      "end_seconds": 141.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.65,
      "end_seconds": 148.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "Right, my aunt has rheumatoid arthritis. Ah, my grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.67,
      "end_seconds": 153.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.99,
      "end_seconds": 172.77,
      "duration_seconds": 15.78,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.05,
      "end_seconds": 192.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Alright, any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.49,
      "end_seconds": 200.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "Yes, cat fur. I'm allergic to walnuts, I get my lips swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 201.47,
      "end_seconds": 210.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Temperature 36.9, pressure 118 over 69, respiratory rate 17. Pulse is 77 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.58,
      "end_seconds": 212.28,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.52,
      "end_seconds": 217.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.23,
      "end_seconds": 233.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.62,
      "end_seconds": 237.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.74,
      "end_seconds": 251.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.61,
      "end_seconds": 265.81,
      "duration_seconds": 11.2,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.31,
      "end_seconds": 270.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.28,
      "end_seconds": 292.35,
      "duration_seconds": 21.07,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors, and we'll watch how it goes. Let me just check I've got this right. You've been wanting contraception, severe, and no breast lumps or migraine with aura."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.23,
      "end_seconds": 295.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.0,
      "end_seconds": 320.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.62,
      "text": "We'll begin with levonorgestrel and ethinylestradiol, 150 micrograms and 30 micrograms, once a day, long term. You take it by mouth. That should help with contraception."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.39,
      "end_seconds": 323.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.77,
      "end_seconds": 328.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Let's review you in three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.12,
      "end_seconds": 330.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.7,
      "end_seconds": 336.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.12,
      "end_seconds": 340.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}